:''For the enemy version see [[Misaki Konno (Enemy)]].''
'''Misaki Konno''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and is exclusive to the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. It is acquired as a drop after beating the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Misaki|Date Chance: Misaki Stages]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 387
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Misaki Konno
|name2 = Misaki Konno CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Misaki Konno CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
It acts as a decent tank for early [[Into the Future]] levels, but gets more irrelevant as you progress due to it's extremely long recharge time and lack of niche compared to [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]], who is more easily accessible and more spammable.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker}}

